self.KB_CONTENT["card:784833"]={"id":"card:784833","ty":"card","sourceId":"784833","title":"『資產折舊憑証』中的『選擇FAX/Email傳送狀態 (C1)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"資產","keywords":["資產","狀態","折舊","傳送"],"y":"other","answer":"* 尚未購買『FAX/Email處理系統』(FEP)，此欄位需隱藏。* 計Y.已傳送、N.未傳送及全部。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
